{"hw":"εἰδοί","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">εἰδοί</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">εἰδοί</span> or <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἰδοί</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ῶν</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">αἱ</span>, <abbr>=</abbr> Lat. <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Idus</cite>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.H.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.89</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rom.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23</span> </span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> Tab.Defix. Aud. 242.49 (Carthage, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">i A. D.</span>): gen. pl. <span class=\"gk\">εἰδυῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.2225</span> </span> (Thisbe); cf. <span class=\"gk\">εἰδυιοί</span>.</div></div>"}